  "confirm": {
    "Ask": {
      "title": "Apply “Like Garuda Linux (Dr460nized)”?",
      "text": "The look <b>Like Garuda Linux (Dr460nized)</b> will be applied to your desktop.<br><br>What will change: colours, window frames, desktop shell theme, Qt application style, GTK theme, icons, cursors, fonts, wallpaper, panel layout, desktop behaviour.<br><br>Rexon builds these parts itself from what your desktop has, close to the original: panel layout, desktop behaviour.<br><br>Covered by the other parts: global theme — in Plasma it is one package of the parts listed here; on this desktop Rexon applies them one by one<br><br>Partly: colours — Qt programs pick it up after you log in again<br><br>Partly: Qt application style — Qt programs pick it up after you log in again<br><br>Partly: panel layout — the dock spans the whole width of the screen and keeps Cinnamon&#39;s own pinned programs: Cinnamon panels can&#39;t be shorter than the screen<br><br>Partly: desktop behaviour — not carried over: wobbly windows, magic lamp minimise, cover switch window switcher, maximised windows without title bars — Muffin has no such settings, these are KWin effects<br><br>Rexon will install the programs it needs: qt6ct, kvantum, beautyline, ttf-fira-sans, ttf-firacode-nerd. Your system will ask for your password.<br><br>You can put everything back at any time with the “Put Back as It Was” button.",
      "yes_text": "Apply",
      "no_text": "Cancel",
      "choices": [],
      "option": null
    }
  },
